1bKx7Z4ms1DQ65_Tv88XkdqRytA&oe=6A11AAF8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "794121865642317", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035334_794121868975650_8463868109182604137_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MM3d6u40hg4Q7kNvwFAc4je&_nc_oc=AdplMFMrZZvaDVg86HWDtCpFYJKnALwhpOlNAC1hAaaUpEVgMlVBw_v2t8OTBFCpcBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af51CRalkwEGB528SeuqzKLVnzj9kWaj9rJLYvcxu1SYAA&oe=6A11BE03"}, "display_name": "BattleGlide", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, jumping, and climbing walls. Choose the time of day you want to fight crime: day, night, and evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Handle weapons realistically. Disarm your enemies or give them a taste of their own medicine!\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans.", "short_description": "BattleGlide is an open world sandbox game where you can move and fight like a super hero.\n\n- Explore a lively and open city by rope swinging, and climbing walls, during the night, day and also evening.\n\n- Take down criminals in countless creative ways, including grabbing, shooting, punching, disarming, or dropping them from the tallest skyscraper...\n\n- Use a variety of weapons to take down your enemies: fists, pistols, assault rifles, large props, baseball bats, explosives, and even frying pans."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://battleglide.com/#/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ghostly Bird Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "